      {
        "id": 264717,
        "name": "Chief Lackey Rich",
        "username": "Chief_Lackey_Rich",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-12-28T22:57:30.318Z",
        "cooked": "<p>FWIW, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HaMzom-mP3I\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">episodes 5</a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o--OXFb6q6w\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">6</a> dropped earlier today.  The Chairman is still dead/missing, the gang war in Rook City is going strong, and our heroes are caught up in the mess.  I think issue 6 wraps things up but haven’t listened to it yet, so there may be more to come.  Or not.</p>\n<p>EDIT:  Nope, session 6 leaves things hanging and they apparently plan another Collection worth of play after a break for another system.  Hopefully their system mastery improves some by then.  They spent 12+ hours playing on-mike and had a less firm grasp on things than some first-timers I’ve run 3-hour demos for.</p>\n<p>Is it weird that this is the third supers game I’ve watched/played in this year featuring a hero named Camazotz?  Who knew Mayan bat gods were so trendy?  It’s probably Bruce Wayne’s fault somehow.</p>\n<p>I refuse to blame Kirk Langstrom, he takes the heat for this sort of thing way too often already.</p>",
